# THE FONT RULE THAT USED TO BE HERE IS GONE, AND ITS ABSENCE IS THE DECISION.
# Zodiak could not be committed -- the ITF Free Font License forbids passing the
# font on through a repository -- so it was ignored here and fetched by hand.
# That works while a person deploys from a machine that has it. It does not work
# when the site is built from the repository, because the build starts on a
# clone and the clone has no font. The face was replaced with Fraunces, which is
# OFL 1.1 and is committed like the other two (ADR 0259). Every face the
# stylesheet declares is now in the tree, and web/scripts/launch-check.mjs
# fails the deploy if one is declared and missing, or present and untracked.

# Local state of the impeccable design tooling. Per-run caches and exploration
# renders, none of it a project artefact.
.impeccable/
